    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. In your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), pick a **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** unit in range of an [objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) you hold. Keep control until an enemy gains the marker at a phase’s close. While it’s yours, roll a D6 when an enemy finishes a qualifying move inside that marker’s range. Normal and Charge Moves qualify, as do [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) and [Fall Back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back). A 4+ deals the enemy D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).",
